{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"expectable-slowwitted-squeaker","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nDuring the F07 documentation-link validation run, the full test suite failed while a fixture created a ticket in an isolated temporary store. `src/rebar/_store/event_commit_git.py` terminated `git commit` after the 30-second `_GIT_TIMEOUT`. The completion-attestation behavior under test did not run. The exact node passed alone in 55.48 seconds.\n\nClosed ticket `moldavite-evasive-elephant` classifies the earlier occurrence as runner I/O contention during a long test job and directs maintainers to track a recurrence separately. Closed ticket `royal-weariless-zebrafish` addresses store-lock acquisition before the write body. It does not address a timeout after acquisition while `git commit` is running.\n\n## Plan\n- Reproduce the timeout under controlled concurrent temporary-store writes and capture subprocess timing.\n- Distinguish host I/O contention from incorrect timeout or fixture behavior.\n- Correct the proven failure class without retrying an unexplained intermittent failure.\n- Add focused regression coverage for the confirmed mechanism.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The root cause is demonstrated with repeatable evidence.\n- [ ] A regression test fails for the confirmed mechanism before the fix.\n- [ ] The fix addresses the failure class rather than one observed run.\n- [ ] Focused store and lifecycle tests pass.\n- [ ] The ticket records the relationship to `moldavite-evasive-elephant` and `royal-weariless-zebrafish`.","id":"bd66-28a4-fd31-4c9f","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["test-reliability","git","store"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Diagnose temporary-store git commit timeout under suite load"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1787396225978182001,"uuid":"e67d92e8-3929-4065-ba29-f5c46302b019"}